# PrioSuite / prio_bank — Architecture Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` for the full guide. For other projects, copy `PRIOSUITE_STARTER.txt`. Match page look via `ui-design-system` rule.

## Feature flow (required)

```
app/(dashboard)/<domain>/<feature>/page.jsx
  → container/<domain>/<feature>/index.jsx
      → Hooks.js + *Apis.js + optional *Reducer.js
  → components/<domain>/<feature>/index.jsx
```

- **page**: metadata + mount container only
- **container**: cookies, hooks, useEffect loads, pass props
- **Hooks**: form (RHF+yup), API calls, Redux dispatch, business rules
- **Apis**: `doGetApiCall`/`doPostApiCall` + `endPoints` only
- **components**: UI only; use `common/formFields`

## Updated packages (required)

Use this stack — do not downgrade or swap stacks unless the user asks:

- `next@^15.2.4` · `react@^18.3.1` · `typescript@5.8.2`
- `tailwindcss@^4.3.3` · `@tailwindcss/postcss@^4.3.3` · `postcss@^8.5.26`
- `react-hook-form@^7.52.1` · `@hookform/resolvers@^3.9.0` · `yup@^1.7.1`
- `@reduxjs/toolkit@^2.11.2` · `react-redux@^9.2.0`
- `axios@^1.16.0` · `date-fns@^3.6.0` · `react-day-picker@8.10.1` (v8 only)
- `@tanstack/react-table@^8.19.3` · `react-hot-toast@^2.6.0`
- Radix via existing `components/ui/*` · `lucide-react` / `react-icons`
- Charts: `recharts@^3` / `ag-charts-react@^13` when needed

When scaffolding a **new project**, generate `package.json` from `AGENTS.md` package table (same majors).

## New screen checklist

1. Thin `page.jsx`
2. `container/.../{index,Hooks,*Apis,*Reducer?}`
3. `components/...` UI
4. Add URLs in `utils/endPoints.js`
5. Register reducer in `redux/configureStore.js` if needed
6. Reuse existing hooks/masters when possible
7. Use packages from the list above only
8. Same page shell/style as existing screens (see ui-design-system rule)

## Do not

- Put API/business logic in `app/` pages or presentational components
- Hardcode API base URLs (use `endPoints.js`)
- Invent a new folder structure
- Commit `.env` / secrets
- Unrelated refactors or unsolicited markdown docs
- Install old stacks (Next 12/13, React 17, Tailwind 3, Formik, Zustand) instead of this stack
